                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-08-30"><hi rendition="#italic">August 30,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Conger announces that the interdiction of cipher messages to Santos has been
                    removed.</p>
